#tutor30
Major General Tyron Spirex
Caliban Strategic Centre
Secret Base 51

Dear % &,

The Katzar forces are moving back. To follow their tracks
all you need to do is watch out for the smoke from the
fires they set off everywhere along their way.

We have spotted several re-assembly points where their
forces are trying to reorganise themselves.
You must take advantage of the state of panic that our
enemies are in and liquidate these pockets before they
develop.

Our allies are at the extreme East of your base. They have
signaled the presence of one of these pockets to the North
of their position. Attack this base as fast as possible,
you will have the support of Colonel Oto Skalpen's
Littlestonians.

Two other nests are to be found, both on an island to the
North.

The end is near, hold fast !

Get Sergent Friks to eat this message !